{"id":"author-minnesnowii-page-2","path":"/author/minnesnowii/page/2/","title":"Minnesnowii, Author at Minnesnowii Shave Ice - Page 2 of 3","description":"","robots":"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1, max-video-preview:-1","ogTitle":"Minnesnowii","ogDescription":"","ogImage":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/85056bdeac1b8e1d4e779be008449e19?s=500&d=mm&r=g","twitterCard":"summary_large_image","jsonLdCount":1,"text":"BOOK US TODAY!  (952) 486-0079\nPrimary Menu\nSkip to content\nJobs\nBlog\nFun With Shave Ice\nEvent and Party Catering\nIn The News\nYoung entrepreneur scores big with state fair booth\n\n  Let’s get one thing straight right off the bat … shave ice is not a snow cone. And yes, it’s shave ice, not shaved ice. That was the lesson being taught by Jason Giandalia, proprietor of Minnesnowii Shave Ice, one of the food sensations at festivals throughout the state including the upcoming Minnesota State… Read More\n\nMN State Fair reveals new foods for 2018\n\n  The annual list of new foods to be offered at the Minnesota State Fair is one of the most anticipated announcements of the calendar year. https://www.kare11.com/article/entertainment/events/minnesota-state-fair/mn-state-fair-reveals-new-foods-for-2018/89-565551431… Read More\n\n5 Most Insane New State Fair Foods\n\nThis one has potential, Hawaiian Shave Ice at the State Fair! A sweet, spicy blend could be good. A world’s worth of sweet treats are all tossed in this cold dessert dish: Mango-flavored shave ice is topped with salty/sour/sweet Mexican chamoy, hit with tart-hot tajin chili powder, with mango boba pearls and a lily-gilding tamarind… Read More\n\nHere are 5 new vendors — and 27 new foods — to try at the 2018 Minnesota State Fair\n\nHere are 5 new vendors — and 27 new foods — to try at the 2018 Minnesota State Fair… Read More\n\nMinnesota State Fair reveals 27 new foods, including tuna poke and Norwegian waffles\n\nThe Mangonada Shave Ice at Minnesnowii Shave Ice, a mango-flavored shave ice that’s dressed with a Mexican sweet-spicy condiment, Tajin chile pepper seasoning and popping mango boba pearls. It’ll be served with a tamarind candy straw, of course. http://www.startribune.com/minnesota-state-fair-reveals-27-new-foods-including-tuna-poke-and-norwegian-waffles/485906611/… Read More\n\nMaple bacon shaved ice\n\nMaple bacon flavor, maple syrup and bacon on top.  Only from Minnesnowii Shaved Ice. https://www.scoopnest.com/user/WCCO/768876809748254720… Read More\n\nPHATPHOOD 2016 MINNESOTA STATE FAIR FOOD REVIEW\n\nPhatphood 2016 Minnesota State Fair Food Review… Read More\n\nThe Story Behind One Of The Fair’s Snowy Treats\n\nIce cream and frozen treats always have a long line when the temperatures rise, and that’s no different for the Minnesnowii shaved ice.   The Story Behind One Of The Fair’s Snowy Treats… Read More\n\nAll the Food Worth Trying at the Minnesota State Fair\n\n…This was actually extremely refreshing, and had a few of us going back for more. Imagine asking for an order of pancakes on ice, and you’ve pretty much got it.   https://andrewzimmern.com/2016/08/24/new-foods-worth-trying-state-fair/… Read More\n\n32 new foods to try at the 2016 Minnesota State Fair\n\n  On Tuesday, the Minnesota State Fair revealed 32 new foods to try this year. In total, nearly 500 foods are available at 300 different concession locations throughout the fairgrounds. Loosen your belts now. http://www.fox9.com/news/32-new-foods-to-try-at-the-minnesota-state-fair… Read More\n\npaging-navigation\n1\n2\n3\nDAYS\n0\n0\n0\nHOURS\n0\n0\nMINUTES\n0\n0\nSECONDS\n0\n0\nJoin us at the MN State Fair!\n\n\nAcross from the GIANT SLIDE!\n\n\n\n6100 Mccoll Dr Unit 381\nSavage MN\nBook Us Today!\n(952) 486-0079\n  \nEvent and Party Catering\nFun With Shave Ice\nIn The Media\nBlog\nJobs\nRochester\nHome\n\n\n\n© 2026 Minnesnowii. All rights reserved. Favicon by Flaticon. Site design by Stargazer LLC.","links":["tel:9524860079","https://www.facebook.com/Minne